[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0009","text":"摄影师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0010","text":"好，路加小姐，\n这边OK了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0020","text":"──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0030","text":"非常棒哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0040","text":"那接下来……\n羽那小姐，准备好了的话我们再来一遍吧。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0050","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0060","text":"──嗯，\n和路加小姐不同的存在感，很出色哦。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0070","text":"而且……\n比刚才更有氛围感……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0080","text":"啊哈，是因为刚才看了路加酱的拍摄吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0090","text":"原来如此～……可能是被带动了呢。\n那也是好事呀！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_03_0100","text":"……"}]
